WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.623
<v NARRATOR>It's the morning after the rookie bonding night at the team house.

00:00:03.623 --> 00:00:09.004
<v NARRATOR>Last night, paramedics took the teammate who was passed out on the bathroom floor to the hospital.

00:00:09.004 --> 00:00:11.474
<v NARRATOR>Dana, a freshman swimmer, is shaken but okay.

00:00:11.474 --> 00:00:15.867
<v NARRATOR>Now Dana's roommate wants to know who on campus should hear about what happened.

00:00:15.867 --> 00:00:17.623
<v NARRATOR>That question has a real answer.

00:00:17.623 --> 00:00:18.941
<v NARRATOR>Actually, more than one.
